<div class="container">
  <h1>Apply to Attend</h1>

  <div class="notice">
    <p><strong>This is an application, not a guaranteed spot.</strong> We review applications and confirm participants by email. Payment is made after acceptance via Interac e-transfer or Wyse to Rhizome Springs.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Pricing</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>$300</strong> — Base tier: makes the event possible</li>
    <li><strong>$350</strong> — Supporter tier: helps us offer scholarships</li>
    <li><strong>$400</strong> — Sustainer tier: makes the event better for everyone</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Partial scholarships are available to those in need — just let us know in your application.</p>
  <p><strong>Kids 12 and under are free.</strong> Older children pay the regular price.</p>

  <noscript>
    <div class="noscript-notice">
      <p>The registration form requires JavaScript. If you are unable to use JavaScript, please email us directly at <a href="mailto:hello@kinfusion.dance">hello@kinfusion.dance</a> to register.</p>
    </div>
  </noscript>

  <div id="register-form-container">
    <p><em>Registration form coming soon. Check back closer to the event opening date.</em></p>
